    "long_instructions": "## AI Safety and Privacy\r\n\r\n1. In the chat window, click **Add File** then **From Library**. Attach the digital artifact that you looked at.\r\n\r\n2. Ask AI:\r\n\r\n   - What public, private, and sensitive information is contained in this artifact?\r\n   - What can you determine about this person?\r\n\r\n3. Compare AI's analysis to your own. Which was more thorough?\r\n",
